  "details": "I haven't seen another post on this and I don't believe I'm the only person who wants this. \n\nTo start, I've already encountered people being annoying with accessories and even witnessed my own friend make a particular phallic object with them. (The eyes and sphere.) It has become an annoyance to me so shortly after its launch and I'm not interested. \n\nI'd love to have the ability, like how I can disable someones avatar, when inspecting the person in the quick menu, have the option to disable that users accessories. In any case where I'd have to wait for moderation, a vote kick, or otherwise, having an option to hide accessories would be wonderful. Having it separate from just hiding the users avatar would allow me to still see the avatar they are using while hiding the nonsense they are acting out.\n\nI do find it quite odd that this was released without this option from the start. I do not want to see someones butt googly eyes.",
